{
  "name": "Log crypto exchange listing alerts from coinsentry to Google Sheets and Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -680,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Log crypto exchange listing alerts to Google Sheets and Telegram\n\n### Who's it for\nCrypto traders, analysts and community admins who want every new coin listing and delisting on major exchanges (Binance, Coinbase, OKX, Bybit, Upbit and more) in a spreadsheet and a Telegram chat, as it happens.\n\n### How it works\n1. [coinsentry](https://coinsentry.app/new-listings) sends a signed webhook for each listing event: `listing_announced` (the exchange published a notice), `listing_live` (trading started) or `delisting`.\n2. The workflow recomputes the HMAC-SHA256 signature of the raw body and drops any request that doesn't match, so nobody else can write to your sheet.\n3. Valid listing events are shaped into one row: time, event, exchange, symbol, pairs, scheduled trading start and the exchange's announcement link.\n4. The row is appended to Google Sheets and posted to Telegram.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Activate the workflow and copy the **Production URL** of *Receive coinsentry webhook*.\n2. In coinsentry, add a webhook channel with that URL and a signing secret, then follow the exchanges you care about (the free plan covers one exchange).\n3. Create a **Crypto** credential and paste the same secret as *HMAC Secret*.\n4. Create a sheet with the columns `detected_at, event, exchange, symbol, pairs, trading_starts_at, source`, then pick it in *Log to Google Sheets*.\n5. Connect Telegram and set your chat ID in *Post to Telegram*.\n\n### Requirements\n- A coinsentry account (free plan works)\n- Google Sheets and Telegram bot credentials\n\n### How to customize\nFilter by exchange or event in *Listing event?*, swap Telegram for Slack or Discord, or add an HTTP Request node to trigger your own trading logic."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Receive coinsentry webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "5d3f1c7e-8a2b-4c6d-9e0f-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "coinsentry-listings",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        },
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Compute expected signature",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "type": "SHA256",
        "action": "hmac",
        "encoding": "hex",
        "binaryData": true,
        "dataPropertyName": "expectedSignature",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "crypto": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "coinsentry webhook secret"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Signature valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        440,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1a2b3c4-+12345678900000010",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-coinsentry-signature'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.expectedSignature }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Listing event?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        660,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1a2b3c4-+12345678900000011",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
              "rightValue": "^(listing_announced|listing_live|delisting)$"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Shape row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        880,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "detected_at",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromMillis($json.body.listing.detectedAtMs, { zone: 'utc' }).toISO() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "event",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.event }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "exchange",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.listing.exchange }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "symbol",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.listing.baseAssetSymbol }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "pairs",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.listing.pairSymbols || []).join(', ') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "trading_starts_at",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.listing.tradingStartsAtMs ? DateTime.fromMillis($json.body.listing.tradingStartsAtMs, { zone: 'utc' }).toISO() : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "source",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.listing.sourceUrl || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f+123456789000-+1234567890",
              "name": "headline",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ { listing_announced: '\ud83d\udce3 Listing announced', listing_live: '\ud83d\udfe2 Now trading', delisting: '\ud83d\udd3b Delisting' }[$json.body.event] }}: {{ $json.body.listing.baseAssetSymbol }} on {{ $json.body.listing.exchange }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
